@startuml
title Add Patient

actor Receptionist
participant DashboardFrame
participant SystemController
participant PatientService
database HospitalRepository

Receptionist -> DashboardFrame: enter name, age, gender, history
DashboardFrame -> SystemController: addPatient(name, age, gender, history)
SystemController -> PatientService: addPatient(name, age, gender, history)
PatientService -> HospitalRepository: addPatient(name, age, gender, history)
HospitalRepository -> HospitalRepository: create Patient with next ID
HospitalRepository --> PatientService: patient
PatientService --> SystemController: patient
SystemController --> DashboardFrame: patient
DashboardFrame -> Receptionist: refresh patient table
@enduml
